{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/ignite-3/pulls/1312", "id": 1109694989, "node_id": "PR_kwDOEsxIDs5CJJoN", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/ignite-3/pull/1312", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/ignite-3/pull/1312.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/ignite-3/pull/1312.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/ignite-3/issues/1312", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/ignite-3/pulls/1312/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/ignite-3/pulls/1312/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/ignite-3/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/ignite-3/issues/1312/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/ignite-3/statuses/5a1220fe6612a80955f845b2f75c394d8dd741f5", "number": 1312, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "IGNITE-18080 Fix flaky test failure in ConfigurationAsmGeneratorTest#testPolymorphicErrors", "user": {"login": "MohsenDehghankar", "id": 45297389, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjk3Mzg5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45297389?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar", "html_url": "https://github.com/MohsenDehghankar", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "### What is the purpose of this PR\r\n\r\n- This PR fixes the flaky test `org.apache.ignite.internal.configuration.asm.ConfigurationAsmGeneratorTest.testPolymorphicErrors`\r\n- The mentioned test may fail or pass without changes made to the source code when it is run in different JVMs due to `Class#getDeclaredFields`'s non-deterministic output order.\r\n\r\n### Why the test fails\r\n\r\n- According to [Java documentation](https://docs.oracle.com/javase/8/docs/api/java/lang/Class.html#getDeclaredFields--) about `getDeclaredFields`, returned array are not sorted and are not in any particular order.\r\n- `ConfigurationUtil#schemaFields()` uses `getDeclaredFields` to return the list of schema fields. This list is passed to `ConfigurationAsmGenerator#createNodeClass()` and then passed to `ConfigurationAsmGenerator#addNodeTraverseChildrenMethod()`.  In this method at line 1249, there is an assertion to check if `schemaFields.get(0)` is PolymorphicId, but due to the non-deterministic order of this list, the first index of the list might not be PolymorphicId and assertion fails.\r\n\r\n### Reproduce the test failure\r\n\r\n- Run the test with 'NonDex' maven plugin. The command to recreate the flaky test failure is `mvn edu.illinois:nondex-maven-plugin:2.1-SNAPSHOT:nondex -pl modules/configuration -Dtest=ConfigurationAsmGeneratorTest#testPolymorphicErrors`\r\n- Fixing the flaky test now, will prevent flaky test failures in future Java versions.\r\n\r\n### Expected Result\r\n\r\n- The tests should run successfully when run with 'NonDex' maven with the same command for recreating the flaky test.\r\n\r\n### Actual Result\r\n\r\n- We get the following error:\r\n```\r\n[INFO] Running org.apache.ignite.internal.configuration.asm.ConfigurationAsmGeneratorTest\r\n[ERROR] Tests run: 1, Failures: 1, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0, Time elapsed: 0.107 s <<< FAILURE! - in org.apache.ignite.internal.configuration.asm.ConfigurationAsmGeneratorTest\r\n[ERROR] org.apache.ignite.internal.configuration.asm.ConfigurationAsmGeneratorTest.testPolymorphicErrors  Time elapsed: 0.085 s  <<< FAILURE!\r\njava.lang.AssertionError: org.apache.ignite.internal.configuration.asm.ConfigurationAsmGeneratorTest$PolymorphicNamedTestConfigurationSchema\r\n        at org.apache.ignite.internal.configuration.asm.ConfigurationAsmGeneratorTest.beforeEach(ConfigurationAsmGeneratorTest.java:110)\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Fix\r\n\r\n- Instead of checking `ConfigurationUtil#isPolymorphicId` on the first element of `schemaFields`, use `schemaFields.stream().anyMatch` to check the whole list.\r\n", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2022-11-03T14:40:59Z", "updated_at": "2022-11-04T09:22:58Z", "closed_at": "2022-11-04T09:22:58Z", "merged_at": "2022-11-04T09:22:57Z", "merge_commit_sha": "de6ee0702398f9ce3022a8e265c633857f3a3d88", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "MohsenDehghankar:fix-flaky", "ref": "fix-flaky", "repo": {"id": 558469071, "node_id": "R_kgDOIUmPzw", "name": "ignite-3", "full_name": "MohsenDehghankar/ignite-3", "owner": {"login": "MohsenDehghankar", "id": 45297389, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjk3Mzg5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45297389?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar", "html_url": "https://github.com/MohsenDehghankar", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MohsenDehghankar/orgs", "rep